{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Connect with {{BUSINESS_NAME}} to shape sensible, habit-led change through a membership for steady practice and clearer routines.">
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f6f8f9;--card:#ffffff;--muted:#63707a;--accent:#2b7a78;--accent-2:#62a19b;--glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);--shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(26,38,48,0.08);--radius:12px}
    html,body{height:100%}
    body{margin:0;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f6f8f9 0%, #eef4f5 100%);color:#123;line-height:1.45}
    header{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(43,122,120,0.06),rgba(98,161,155,0.04));backdrop-filter:blur(2px);padding:20px 28px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(18,48,50,0.03)}
    .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto}
    .brand{font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);letter-spacing:0.2px}
    nav a{color:#174b4a;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:600}
    nav a[href$="contact.html"]{background:var(--accent);color:white}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:24px}

    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:22px;align-items:start}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:20px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:1.6rem;color:#0f3b3a}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Mood selector */
    .mood{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .mood .options{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .mood button{background:#f3fbfb;border:1px solid rgba(43,122,120,0.08);padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#0d4746}
    .mood button.active{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(43,122,120,0.14)}

    .method{margin-top:12px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(98,161,155,0.04),rgba(43,122,120,0.02));color:#0a3b3a}
    .method h3{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:1.05rem}
    .method p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}

    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .btn{padding:12px 16px;border-radius:10px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    .btn.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white}
    .btn.ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(10,30,30,0.06)}

    /* Progress planner */
    .planner{margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 280px;gap:16px}
    .goals{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
    .goal-item{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;background:#fbfeff;border:1px solid rgba(10,30,30,0.03)}
    .goal-item input{transform:scale(1.1)}
    .path-map{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(10,30,30,0.04)}
    .weeks{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:6px}
    .day{height:26px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#f7fbfb,#eef6f6);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px;color:#0a3b3a}
    .day.milestone{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:white;font-weight:700}
    .progress-bar{height:12px;background:#e6f1f0;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;margin-top:12px}
    .progress-fill{height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));width:0%;transition:width 500ms ease}

    footer{max-width:1100px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.95rem}

    /* subtle pattern SVG in the corner */
    .pattern{position:fixed;right:12px;bottom:12px;opacity:0.06;width:220px;height:220px}

    @media(max-width:880px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.planner{grid-template-columns:1fr}.nav{flex-wrap:wrap}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="nav">
      <div class="brand">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <nav style="margin-left:18px">
        <a href="index.html">Overview</a>
        <a href="about.html">Philosophy</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="programs.html">Journeys</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Plans</a>
        <a href="testimonials.html">Stories</a>
        <a href="book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600">
        <span style="margin-right:10px">{{PHONE}}</span>
        <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700">{{EMAIL}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="card">
        <h1>Let's shape a steady next month</h1>
        <p class="lead">Membership guidance that focuses on routine, measurable habits, and short practices you can repeat. Use the tools below to surface an approach that suits your day and build a 30-day path map.</p>

        <div class="mood">
          <label style="font-weight:700;color:#214b4b">How are you right now?</label>
          <div class="options" role="tablist" aria-label="mood choices">
            <button data-mood="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
            <button data-mood="low" >Low energy</button>
            <button data-mood="restless">Restless</button>
            <button data-mood="focused">Focused</button>
            <button data-mood="steady">Steady</button>
          </div>

          <div class="method" id="methodCard" aria-live="polite">
            <h3 id="methodTitle">A short orientation</h3>
            <p id="methodText">Choose how you feel to reveal a tailored first step and a suggested meeting rhythm within the membership.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cta-row">
            <button id="primaryCta" class="btn primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
            <button id="secondaryCta" class="btn ghost">Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</button>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick contact</h3>
        <p class="lead">Prefer to send a note? Tell us what matters and we'll respond in 1–2 business days.</p>
        <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="return false;">
          <label style="display:block;margin-top:12px;font-weight:600">Name</label>
          <input id="name" type="text" placeholder="Your name" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9f0ef">
          <label style="display:block;margin-top:12px;font-weight:600">Email</label>
          <input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9f0ef">
          <label style="display:block;margin-top:12px;font-weight:600">Message</label>
          <textarea id="msg" rows="4" placeholder="A few lines about what you want to achieve" style="width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e9f0ef"></textarea>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center">
            <button id="sendBtn" class="btn primary">Send message</button>
            <small style="color:var(--muted)">Or call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></small>
          </div>
        </form>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:20px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Plan a 30-day path</h3>
      <div class="planner">
        <div>
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;color:var(--muted)">Select one or more outcomes to assemble a practical month. We turn chosen targets into weekly focuses and short daily practices.</p>
          <div class="goals" id="goals">
            <label class="goal-item"><input type="checkbox" value="sleep"> Improve sleep regularity</label>
            <label class="goal-item"><input type="checkbox" value="movement"> Gentle daily movement</label>
            <label class="goal-item"><input type="checkbox" value="stress"> Stress-management moments</label>
            <label class="goal-item"><input type="checkbox" value="focus"> Short focus sessions</label>
            <label class="goal-item"><input type="checkbox" value="hydration"> Consistent hydration habit</label>
            <label class="goal-item"><input type="checkbox" value="meals"> Balanced simple meals</label>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
            <button id="buildBtn" class="btn primary">Build path</button>
            <button id="resetBtn" class="btn ghost">Clear</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <div class="path-map" id="pathMap">
            <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
              <strong id="planTitle">Your 30-day outline</strong>
              <small id="planSummary" style="color:var(--muted)">No goals selected</small>
            </div>

            <div class="weeks" id="weeks" style="margin-top:12px">
              <!-- Days will be injected here -->
            </div>

            <div class="progress-bar" aria-hidden="false">
              <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill" style="width:0%"></div>
            </div>
            <small id="progressText" style="display:block;margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)">Completion estimate: 0%</small>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px" class="card">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0">Frequently asked</h3>
      <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)"><strong>Is this medical advice?</strong> No. The membership focuses on routines, habit design, and practical frameworks to support daily steadiness. It does not diagnose or treat conditions.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)"><strong>How often will we meet?</strong> Membership includes a recommended rhythm based on your initial orientation: weekly short check-ins or biweekly reviews depending on your chosen path.</p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div style="flex:1" class="card">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Ready to begin?</h3>
        <p style="margin:0;color:var(--muted)">Follow the mood selector for a first step, build your 30-day plan, then choose a membership cadence that fits your schedule.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <button id="finalCta" class="btn primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto">
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Membership guidance for steady practice.</div>
      <div style="color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:inherit">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <svg class="pattern" viewBox="0 0 100 100" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
        <stop offset="0" stop-color="#bfe6e4" />
        <stop offset="1" stop-color="#e6f6f4" />
      </linearGradient>
    </defs>
    <rect x="0" y="0" width="100" height="100" fill="url(#g)" rx="18"/>
    <g fill="rgba(255,255,255,0.4)">
      <circle cx="22" cy="28" r="3" />
      <circle cx="34" cy="48" r="2.5" />
      <circle cx="60" cy="18" r="2" />
      <circle cx="78" cy="52" r="3.5" />
      <circle cx="45" cy="72" r="2.2" />
    </g>
  </svg>

  <script>
    // Mood-to-Method
    const moodButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.mood .options button');
    const methodTitle = document.getElementById('methodTitle');
    const methodText = document.getElementById('methodText');
    const primaryCta = document.getElementById('primaryCta');
    const finalCta = document.getElementById('finalCta');

    const moodMap = {
      overwhelmed: {
        title: 'A short reset',
        text: 'Tiny structure to clear decision fatigue: a single 10–12 minute session, a short breathing scaffold, plus two easy checkpoint actions for today.',
        cta: 'Start a gentle reset'
      },
      low: {
        title: 'Energy-first micro-cycle',
        text: 'Emphasize brief, energizing practices and a simplified evening routine to rebuild momentum across a week.',
        cta: 'Begin energy micro-cycle'
      },
      restless: {
        title: 'Anchor and ground',
        text: 'Short focus anchors and movement bursts that provide a predictable frame for fragmented days.',
        cta: 'Try the anchor sequence'
      },
      focused: {
        title: 'Leverage current focus',
        text: 'Build on what is working with targeted tasks and a compact weekly review to deepen gains without extra overhead.',
        cta: 'Join the focused track'
      },
      steady: {
        title: 'Maintain & refine',
        text: 'Small habit edits and a monthly touchpoint to sustain and tidy routines already proving reliable.',
        cta: 'Adopt the maintenance cycle'
      }
    };

    function clearActive(){ moodButtons.forEach(b=>b.classList.remove('active')) }

    moodButtons.forEach(btn=>{
      btn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
        const k = btn.getAttribute('data-mood');
        clearActive(); btn.classList.add('active');
        const payload = moodMap[k];
        methodTitle.textContent = payload.title;
        methodText.textContent = payload.text;
        primaryCta.textContent = payload.cta;
        finalCta.textContent = payload.cta;
      });
    });

    // Planner / Path map
    const buildBtn = document.getElementById('buildBtn');
    const resetBtn = document.getElementById('resetBtn');
    const weeks = document.getElementById('weeks');
    const planTitle = document.getElementById('planTitle');
    const planSummary = document.getElementById('planSummary');
    const progressFill = document.getElementById('progressFill');
    const progressText = document.getElementById('progressText');

    function makeDays(selectedGoals){
      weeks.innerHTML = '';
      const totalDays = 30;
      // We'll display five columns of six days to form a compact grid (5x6=30)
      const cols = 5; const rows = 6;
      // milestones: every 7 days per goal (rounded), mark day as milestone
      let milestones = new Set();
      selectedGoals.forEach((g,idx)=>{
        for(let d=7; d<=totalDays; d+=7){
          // offset each goal slightly so milestones distribute
          let day = (d + idx) % totalDays || totalDays;
          milestones.add(day);
        }
      });
      // fill with day blocks
      for(let r=0;r<rows;r++){
        for(let c=0;c<cols;c++){
          const dayNum = r*cols + c + 1;
          const el = document.createElement('div'); el.className='day'; el.textContent = dayNum;
          if(milestones.has(dayNum)) el.classList.add('milestone');
          weeks.appendChild(el);
        }
      }

      // Summary & estimated adherence
      const estimate = Math.min(95, Math.max(10, selectedGoals.length * 18 + (selectedGoals.includes('focus')?5:0)));
      planSummary.textContent = `${selectedGoals.length} target(s) • weekly focuses seeded`;
      progressFill.style.width = estimate + '%';
      progressText.textContent = 'Completion estimate: ' + estimate + '%';
    }

    buildBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const checked = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#goals input:checked')).map(i=>i.value);
      if(checked.length===0){
        planTitle.textContent = 'Your 30-day outline';
        planSummary.textContent = 'No goals selected';
        weeks.innerHTML = '';
        progressFill.style.width = '0%';
        progressText.textContent = 'Completion estimate: 0%';
        return;
      }
      planTitle.textContent = '30-day path';
      makeDays(checked);

      // small nudge to change CTA based on number of goals
      if(checked.length>=4){
        primaryCta.textContent = 'Start the comprehensive cycle';
        finalCta.textContent = 'Start the comprehensive cycle';
      } else if(checked.length>=2){
        primaryCta.textContent = 'Begin a focused month';
        finalCta.textContent = 'Begin a focused month';
      } else {
        primaryCta.textContent = 'Begin a simple month';
        finalCta.textContent = 'Begin a simple month';
      }
    });

    resetBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>{
      document.querySelectorAll('#goals input').forEach(i=>i.checked=false);
      weeks.innerHTML='';
      planSummary.textContent='No goals selected';
      progressFill.style.width='0%';
      progressText.textContent='Completion estimate: 0%';
      primaryCta.textContent='{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
      finalCta.textContent='{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
      clearActive(); methodTitle.textContent='A short orientation'; methodText.textContent='Choose how you feel to reveal a tailored first step and a suggested meeting rhythm within the membership.';
    });

    // Contact form nicety (no backend) — quick client validation
    document.getElementById('sendBtn').addEventListener('click',()=>{
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const msg = document.getElementById('msg').value.trim();
      if(!name || !email || !msg){
        alert('Please fill name, email and a short message.');
        return;
      }
      alert('Thanks, ' + name + '. We have your message and will follow up at ' + email + '.');
      document.getElementById('contactForm').reset();
    });

    // Initial seed: set placeholder CTA label
    primaryCta.textContent = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';
    finalCta.textContent = '{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}';

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and feature notes for wellness_coach-MORE-2026-02-17T03-48-06-564Z-024

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — interactive contact and planning page.

Purpose:
- Provide a calm, clinical-facing contact page for a membership-driven wellness coach site.
- Let visitors express current state and immediately see a recommended approach.
- Allow visitors to select goals and receive a simple 30-day path map with milestones and an estimated completion score.

Key interactive features implemented (pure HTML/CSS/JS, no external services):
1) Mood-to-Method selector
   - Buttons represent current states (Overwhelmed, Low energy, Restless, Focused, Steady).
   - Clicking a mood updates the method card copy and changes the primary CTA text to a tailored phrase.
   - The initial CTA label uses the placeholder {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} so server-side systems can replace it when needed.

2) Progress meter / Path map
   - Users select goals via checkboxes (sleep, movement, stress, focus, hydration, meals).
   - "Build path" generates a compact 5x6 grid representing 30 days, and marks distributed milestones tied to selected goals.
   - A progress estimate is calculated from the number and type of goals and updates a progress bar and summary.
   - The CTA text adjusts based on how many goals were selected to suggest an appropriate membership entry point.

3) Contact form
   - Lightweight client-side validation and confirmation alert. No backend integration is included here.

Accessibility & notes:
- The mood area updates are announced via simple content changes; the method card has aria-live behavior via DOM updates.
- No images, external fonts, or CDNs used. A small inline SVG provides visual texture for the page corner.
- Placeholders included and required by the generator: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.

Design choices consistent with the brief:
- Clinical, calm voice with concise guidance and clear affordances.
- Membership model emphasized via CTA phrasing and suggested rhythms in the method copy.
- No medical claims; all language focuses on routines, habits, and frameworks.

Integration tips:
- Replace placeholders server-side or via a templating engine before serving.
- The contact form is intentionally isolated from backend logic; wire the form submit to an endpoint if you want persistence.
- If you add an assets/img/pattern.svg in a later chunk, consider replacing the inline corner SVG with that asset for consistent branding."}
